      "type": "entity",
      "quote": "Hydrospider AG, Hyundai Hydrogen Mobility AG, H2 Energy AG, and Assocation pro H2 Mobilität Schweiz",
      "gist": "Four companies building the world's first commercial renewable hydrogen cycle"
    },
    {
      "type": "claim",
      "quote": "constructing the world’s first commercial cycle for renewable hydrogen",
